# A piece stored when twenty-two DX voices were built in: the pluck's sound numbers from 34 up (the player's own voices) are eight places on, since thirty are now
# (the bank written by this firmware has its mark in the header; one marked as older is renumbered when it loads).
seed 0
wait 3000
setpar 99 34
wait 100
expect par99 34
tap GLO
tap SAVE
wait 500
expect saved 1
# as written now: it comes back as it is
reboot
wait 500
expect par99 34
# as an older firmware wrote it: a user voice's number, renumbered
setpar 99 34
tap GLO
tap SAVE
wait 500
oldimage
reboot
wait 500
expect par99 42
